Hi Avery,

Asana for Startups gives eligible companies 12 months of Asana Advanced at no cost: unlimited projects, goals, portfolios, workload, and reporting for up to 50 users.

To qualify:
- Under $10M in funding
- Fewer than 50 employees
- Not currently on a paid Asana plan

Founders use Advanced to run company goals alongside the work that ladders up to them, so the "are we on track?" question has a live answer instead of a Monday meeting.

Apply in under five minutes: https://asana.com/l/startups?r=m9v3q

Prefer a walkthrough first? Our startup team runs a 20-minute group demo every Tuesday.

